n a major upgrade for developers: You can now upload with butler directly in the app w...</span></div></li><li><div><a href="/updates/ameyega-mode" class="post_link"><img class="post_image" data-lazy_src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI2NDYyNDEzLnBuZw==/300x168%23c/Rdd2Nr.png"/></a></div><div class="post_title"><a href="/updates/ameyega-mode">Ameyega Mode</a></div><div class="post_summary"><span class="summary_text">Ameyega mode is now over, thanks everyone. If you missed it, you can visit this URL when logged in to see it: https://it...</span></div></li><li><div><a href="/updates/what-is-creator-day" class="post_link"><img class="post_image" data-lazy_src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI0MzA0NjUwLnBuZw==/300x168%23c/xSebB1.png"/></a></div><div class="post_title"><a href="/updates/what-is-creator-day">What is Creator Day?</a></div><div class="post_summary"><span class="summary_text">Creator Day is a special 24-hour event where itch.io waives its platform fee on all sales across the site. During Creato...</span></div></li><li><div><a href="/blog/1124058/creator-day-black-friday-sales-this-friday" class="post_link"><img class="post_image" data-lazy_src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI0MjY2NjMwLnBuZw==/300x168%23c/qJZYNA.png"/></a></div><div class="post_title"><a href="/blog/1124058/creator-day-black-friday-sales-this-friday">Creator Day &amp; Black Friday Sales this Friday!</a></div><div class="post_summary"><span class="summary_text">Creator Day returns this Friday November 28th! From 8am to 8am UTC (midnight to midnight Pacific) on Friday, we’re wai...</span></div></li><li><div><a href="/blog/1096153/the-itchio-halloween-sale-2025-is-live" class="post_link"><img class="post_image" data-lazy_src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzIzODE4MjI3LnBuZw==/300x168%23c/ZGc%2B2r.png"/></a></div><div class="post_title"><a href="/blog/1096153/the-itchio-halloween-sale-2025-is-live">The itch.io Halloween Sale 2025 is live!</a></div><div class="post_summary"><span class="summary_text">The sha